sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor MHS as Mahasiswa
    participant UI as Portal KRS
    participant KrsSvc as EnrollmentService
    participant Val as KRSValidator
    participant DB as Database
    participant Notif as NotificationService
    actor PA as Dosen PA

    MHS->>UI: Pilih daftar kelas & klik Submit KRS
    UI->>KrsSvc: submitKRS(nim, semester, listScheduleId)
    KrsSvc->>DB: getRiwayatNilaiDanJadwal(nim, semester)
    DB-->>KrsSvc: riwayatGrade, detailKelasDipilih

    KrsSvc->>Val: validateAll(enrollment)
    Val->>Val: 1. MaxSKSValidationRule (totalSKS <= 24)
    Val->>Val: 2. PrerequisiteValidationRule (cek nilai lulus MK prasyarat)
    Val->>Val: 3. ScheduleConflictValidationRule (cek hari & jam bentrok)

    alt Validasi Gagal (SKS > 24 / Prasyarat Kurang / Jadwal Bentrok)
        Val-->>KrsSvc: ValidationResult(valid=false, daftarError)
        KrsSvc-->>UI: HTTP 422 (Rincian pelanggaran aturan KRS)
        UI-->>MHS: Tampilkan alasan penolakan (prasyarat/SKS/bentrok)
    else Semua Aturan Validasi Lulus
        Val-->>KrsSvc: ValidationResult(valid=true)
        KrsSvc->>DB: simpanEnrollment(status="Pending Approval")
        DB-->>KrsSvc: enrollmentId
        KrsSvc->>Notif: kirimNotifikasiApproval(dosenPAId, enrollmentId)
        Notif-->>PA: Notifikasi: Mahasiswa mengajukan KRS baru
        KrsSvc-->>UI: HTTP 200 (Status: Pending Approval)
        UI-->>MHS: Tampilkan status KRS menunggu persetujuan Dosen PA
    end